// TEST: Unit Binding Mismatch (rejects)
// ERROR: BL3006
// A unit-annotated binding cannot be initialized from a value carrying a
// DIFFERENT unit signature (unification is unit-strict when both sides
// are annotated; bare literals still flow in freely).
// BL3006 (unit mismatch), not BL3001 (type mismatch): scaled units moved
// the annotated-let seam off plain unification -- the value is checked
// against the annotation's BARE type so a magnitude can be converted, which
// leaves the signature comparison to the conversion step. It reports the
// specific failure, matching units/015's argument-position sibling.
Unit meters
Unit seconds
let t: Float<seconds> = 5.0
let d: Float<meters> = t
